!
! What the owner holds in one currency, in Trebago: the exact sum of the
! accounts' balances in minor units, added from the first; a partial sum
! past 64 bits is refused, never rounded or wrapped.
trebago holdings
  in  balance(n)
  out holdings
  holdings = sum(i, balance(i))
end
